(92, 1, '2024-08-29 10:20:15', '2024-08-29 08:20:15', '<p>Apporte un peu de nature chez toi ! Notre boutique en ligne te propose tout ce dont tu as besoin pour cultiver tes propres plantes, des kits complets aux accessoires indispensables. Facile, fun, et zéro stress.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\">\n									En savoir plus\n					</a>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>La Vie des Plantes</h2>		\n		<p>Kits de plantes en pots, accessoires</p>		\n			<a href=\"/boutique\">\n									Accédez à la boutique\n					</a>\n                            <!--Product Start-->\n                                                                                            <a href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/produit/mini-kit-de-plantation-biologique-radis-et-capucine-trefle/\"> \n                                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/clover-2722470_1280-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"Trèfles\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/clover-2722470_1280-300x300.jpg 300w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/clover-2722470_1280-100x100.jpg 100w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/clover-2722470_1280-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /> \n                                          