(136, 1, '2024-09-17 17:23:42', '2024-09-17 15:23:42', '<p><strong>Depuis quatre générations</strong>, La vie des plantes, basée à Angers, partage son expertise pour vous aider à faire germer vos projets verts.<br></p>		\n													<img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Photo du groupe de l&#039;entreprise\" srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-600x400.jpg 600w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />', 'A propos', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '78-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-09-17 17:23:42', '2024-09-17 15:23:42', '', 78, 'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=136', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(114, 1, '2024-09-17 17:01:08', '2024-09-17 15:01:08', '<p>Apporte un peu de nature chez toi ! Notre boutique en ligne te propose tout ce dont tu as besoin pour cultiver tes propres plantes, des kits complets aux accessoires indispensables. Facile, fun, et zéro stress.<br></p>		\n													<img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Photo du groupe de l&#039;entreprise\" srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438-600x400.jpg 600w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/2149311438.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />', 'A propos', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '78-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-09-17 17:01:08', '2024-09-17 15:01:08', '', 78, 'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=114', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
